    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enter <strong>Mobspawn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152960/extras/7a366b76f96db82e8544cbaf51292cfa.poster.avif?t=1754967220\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152960/extras/7a366b76f96db82e8544cbaf51292cfa.gif?t=1754967220\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A relentless isometric gauntlet where every floor tests your wit and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed with a vacuum and your ingenuity, repurpose the environment itself as your ordnance.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fling furniture, debris, and the scraps of dispatched foes to clear your path to the elevator.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect and scavenge for upgrades to improve your abilities... you'll need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>How high will you ascend?</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enter <strong>Mobspawn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152960/extras/7a366b76f96db82e8544cbaf51292cfa.poster.avif?t=1754967220\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152960/extras/7a366b76f96db82e8544cbaf51292cfa.gif?t=1754967220\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A relentless isometric gauntlet where every floor tests your wit and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed with a vacuum and your ingenuity, repurpose the environment itself as your ordnance.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fling furniture, debris, and the scraps of dispatched foes to clear your path to the elevator.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect and scavenge for upgrades to improve your abilities... you'll need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>How high will you ascend?</i></p>",
